{"event": "turn", "session_id": "532fda9f9e494f22a8cd[号码]", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T03:48:22.480486+00:00", "message": "介绍一下绿茶", "resolved_question": "介绍一下绿茶", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 16.812, "model_calls": 2, "input_tokens": 4527, "output_tokens": 747, "response": {"answer": "**绿茶简介**\n\n绿茶是一种按加工方式划分的茶类。根据 ISO 20715:2023《茶——茶类分类》，绿茶通过快速加热鲜叶使酶失活，随后可能经过揉捻、做形或粉碎、干燥等步骤制成。与红茶相比，绿茶的关键加工区别在于：不经过红茶工艺中刻意通气的氧化过程（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）。\n\n**关于“发酵”的说明**\n\n在茶叶加工术语中，红茶制造里的“发酵”通常指叶片破损接触空气后的酶促氧化，与微生物发酵不同。绿茶属于几乎不进行刻意氧化的一类，乌龙茶为部分氧化（来源：Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea）。\n\n**品种与茶类的关系**\n\n茶树品种与茶类是两个不同概念：品种指栽培植物的选育类型，而绿茶、红茶、乌龙茶等指加工后的产品类型。同一品种用不同加工方法可形成不同的化学成分特征，因此品种本身并不单独决定成品茶类或香气（来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves）。\n\n**工艺分类提示**\n\n“传统工艺（Orthodox）”与“CTC（压碎、撕裂、卷曲）”属于制造方式，与六大茶类的分类维度不同；印度茶叶局认可传统工艺可生产红茶和绿茶（来源：Tea Board India — Modalities and Scheme Guidelines）。\n\n**需要说明的是**：以上为茶类加工与分类的通用知识。关于具体绿茶商品的风味、用途、价格、库存等，本次未提供相关实时数据，无法验证，建议您提供具体商品名称以便查询。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/fr/records/6473b0a3542a3f9f03b31231", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea Board India — Modalities and Scheme Guidelines", "url": "https://www.teaboard.gov.in/pdf/schemes/Modalities_and_scheme_guidelines_12th_Plan.pdf", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "介绍一下绿茶", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4}], "output_order": ["s1"], "source": "rules"}, "unmet_requirements": [], "pii_redacted": false}}
